  "description": "The light that fell from the heavens shared a gift with its creations, seeking connection. But humans and their dark hearts would corrupt the very essence of the gift, turning their desires and themselves into twisted, misshapen monstrosities. Yet, there was hope. Heroes would arise--heroes, who would not only stare into the abyss but fight the horrors in it. The gift was golden, but darkness festered within. Now, murky whispers tug on the edge of our consciousness, daring us to make the pact... But with who?\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
